#: ../../source/quality/dependency_matrix.md:13
#: 6ec3ffeef4c34008bc40a144c1b6b527
msgid "1.1. Context & Problem Statement"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/dependency_matrix.md:15
#: 8fdff2e4f7fb4ad784506686f5f40c0b
msgid ""
"`findfmt` uses `hatchling` as its PEP 517 build backend in "
"`pyproject.toml` and relies on `uv` for virtual environment creation, "
"lockfile synchronization (`uv.lock`), and test execution. Standard CI "
"jobs execute `uv sync --locked --all-groups`, which validates only a "
"single resolution point: `--resolution highest --prerelease disallow "
"--fork-strategy fewest`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/dependency_matrix.md:20
#: 61d0183e5db54c8aa02b14c390e3e929
msgid ""
"Relying solely on the default lockfile leaves three failure modes "
"untested:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/dependency_matrix.md:22
#: e3a18b798fe04d12ab3b227cf64d9ed8
msgid ""
"**Lower-Bound Drift**: Direct dependency floors declared in "
"`pyproject.toml` (`identify>=2.6`, `pathspec>=1.0.1`, `pyyaml>=6.0.1`, "
"`rich>=13.8`, `typer>=0.16`, `typing-extensions>=4`) can silently bit-rot"
" when new code relies on features added in later minor releases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/dependency_matrix.md:25
#: 2d0cf779a6304d2caebc0a21954dc0c0
msgid ""
"**Upstream Pre-Release Breakages**: Upcoming alpha, beta, or release-"
"candidate versions of direct or transitive dependencies (`click`, `rich`,"
" `typer`, `pathspec`, `pytest`) can introduce breaking API changes before"
" stable publication."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/dependency_matrix.md:28
#: ef4544aba51448cc9398e4d09c6c92c2
msgid ""
"**Multi-Interpreter & Fork-Strategy Divergence**: Marker evaluation "
"across supported Python interpreters (`3.11` through `3.15`) and `uv` "
"resolver fork strategies can yield distinct package selections on minimum"
" versus maximum runtimes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/dependency_matrix.md:32
#: 6c6a46157742465499e830b87d3c7946
msgid "1.2. Architecture Decision Summary"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/dependency_matrix.md:34
#: de949a8607b347b995011a1e5d073d47
msgid ""
"**Status**: Accepted (Milestone `v1.1.2`, Issue "
"[#426](https://github.com/bdperkin/findfmt/issues/426))."
msgstr ""

