#: ../../source/quality/dependency_matrix.md:65
#: c5919f8d8649465fbbaf9f45099a3125
msgid "2.1. Rationale for Hybrid GitHub Actions + `tools/verify_quality.py`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/dependency_matrix.md:67
#: 63742330c1d745889f01a684eb18c8cc
msgid ""
"**Single Resolver & Zero Lock Drift**: `uv` is the sole environment "
"manager and package resolver. Driving ephemeral virtual environments (`uv"
" venv` + `uv pip install`) directly from `tools/verify_quality.py` "
"locally and `strategy.matrix` in GitHub Actions guarantees identical "
"resolver semantics without translating flags through `tox` or `hatch` "
"wrapper layers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/dependency_matrix.md:71
#: 3c2d00439cc64b42803c9d86f4eebaf0
msgid ""
"**Single Source of Truth for Python Versions**: `tools/verify_quality.py`"
" reads the supported interpreter list (`3.11`, `3.12`, `3.13`, `3.14`, "
"`3.15`) directly from the `Programming Language :: Python :: 3.X` Trove "
"classifiers in `pyproject.toml`, preventing drift between "
"`pyproject.toml`, `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, and local runner "
"definitions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/dependency_matrix.md:75
#: f425f17787c54d6f98dc97eb60414995
msgid ""
"**Minimal Dependency Surface**: Keeping orchestration inside "
"`tools/verify_quality.py` avoids adding `nox`, `tox`, `tox-uv`, or the "
"full `hatch` CLI to `[dependency-groups].dev`."
msgstr ""

